### 前置说明
# ask-question 为 SSE 流式接口，需保持连接读取事件流；回答结束时服务端会发送 event=done 的 [DONE] 标记。

### ask-question
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/agent/ask-question
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream;charset=UTF-8

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "conversationId": "conv_20260826000001",
  "question": "知识库平台 Agent 文档的修改时间是多久？"
}

### ask-question 参数缺失（触发 @Validated 校验）
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/agent/ask-question
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream;charset=UTF-8

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "conversationId": "conv_20260826000001"
}

### submit-feedback 有用
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/agent/submit-feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "conversationId": "conv_20260826000001",
  "messageId": "20260826002101130000229028",
  "type": "USEFUL"
}

### submit-feedback 无用
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/agent/submit-feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "conversationId": "conv_20260826000001",
  "messageId": "20260826002101130000229024",
  "type": "NOT_USEFUL",
  "reason": "答案与问题不相关"
}
